d90777cf tests(sve): add movbe_slf_sweep_sve — multi-width 16/32/64-bit SLF round-trip probe
1023c841 tests(sve): fix insert_extract_sve shared-buffer race + unreproducible RNG

## Files changed
 tests/cpu/sve/core179/movbe_slf_sweep_sve.cpp | 292 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
